662
00:48:42,919 --> 00:48:47,055
Escolher! Pegue, pegue, pegue, pegue.

663
00:48:47,056 --> 00:48:50,025
Estou fora deste mundo. Te aviso quando voltar.

664
00:48:50,026 --> 00:48:51,894
Ei, Michelle, ouça,

665
00:48:51,895 --> 00:48:53,896
