712
00:51:09,065 --> 00:51:11,133
Ela...

713
00:51:11,134 --> 00:51:12,635
Johnny!

714
00:51:16,306 --> 00:51:17,974
Oh meu Deus.

715
00:51:31,921 --> 00:51:33,121
Onde você está?

716
00:51:33,122 --> 00:51:34,890
Onde?

717
00:51:34,891 --> 00:51:36,960
